WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.320
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am&nbsp;
going to explain a comedy drama film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:11.440
called “Secret Zoo.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:22.800
Kang Tae-Soo works a dead-end temp position at a&nbsp;
renowned law firm JH. Tae-Soo dreams of one day&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:28.640
landing a permanent position at the firm but so&nbsp;
far he has been unsuccessful. Tae-Soo’s law firm&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:34.160
has been hit with scandals after scandals.&nbsp;
Currently, its vice president Min Chul Hyun&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:38.720
is in prison for stock manipulation and&nbsp;
embezzlement. A group of protesters have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:44.880
been camping outside the JH Headquarter for more&nbsp;
than a week to protest against the firm for being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:51.200
unjust and exploitative. Tae-Soo’s college friend&nbsp;
Song also works at the firm as an associate. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:56.240
latter always invites Tae-Soo for drinks on the&nbsp;
weekends but Tae-Soo doesn’t want to face his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:03.600
friends who are a lot more successful than him.&nbsp;
One day, JH’s CEO Mr. Hwang is mobbed outside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:09.280
the HQ by the protesters. The protestors hurl&nbsp;
obscenities at Hwang, which aggravates him and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:15.200
he gets into a fight with the mob. The mob easily&nbsp;
overpowers Hwang and seeing his boss in trouble,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:21.040
Tae-Soo puts himself in the line of fire to&nbsp;
save him. The CEO takes notes of Tae-Soo being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:26.640
manhandled by the crowd as he drives away.
Impressed by him, Hwang invites Tae-Soo for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:31.120
dinner, where he meets Rakwan group’s&nbsp;
Vice President and Hyun’s sister&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:37.120
Min Chae-Ryung. After Ryung leaves, Hwang gets to&nbsp;
know more about Tae-Soo. Hwang promises to give&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:44.160
Tae-Soo a permanent position at JH if he manages&nbsp;
to revitalize a failing zoo called Dongsan Park,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:51.760
that one of JH’s UK-based clients Gabrield Inc.&nbsp;
has acquired. Tae-Soo couldn’t be more excited&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:57.440
and accepts the deal immediately. However, Hwang&nbsp;
gives him an ultimatum and says that he has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.440 --> 00:02:03.600
exactly 3 months to revitalize the failing zoo. 
In the next scene, Tae-Soo quickly heads over to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:10.240
the zoo and lo and behold, he learns that the zoo&nbsp;
has no animals except for a troubled Polar bear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:15.600
and some other animals that no one would pay to&nbsp;
see. Tae-Soo talks to the remaining zoo staff&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.600 --> 00:02:19.520
and they reveal that the zoo’s animals&nbsp;
have been taken away by the loan sharks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:25.280
that the zoo’s previous owners owed money to.&nbsp;
The zoo staff consists of former director Seo,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:31.280
Veterinarian Han, Hye-Kyung, and Gun-wook. After&nbsp;
learning that Tae-Soo is the new director of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:37.440
zoo, Seo proceeds to leave but Tae-Soo convinces&nbsp;
him to stay, saying his experience will be needed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:43.760
to bring this zoo back to life. Tae-Soo proposes&nbsp;
buying animals but he is told that one can’t buy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:48.720
endangered animals. They could seek special&nbsp;
permission for research and breeding from the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:54.320
government but it could take well over 3 months.
Later that night, while returning back to his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:54.320 --> 00:03:00.080
living quarters inside the zoo, Tae-Soo is given&nbsp;
a scare of a lifetime by a stuffed animal which he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:05.920
mistakes for a real tiger. One of the laid off zoo&nbsp;
staff reveals that he is taking the stuffed toy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:11.280
to sell it for some money. The next morning,&nbsp;
Tae-Soo relays his problem to Hwang but the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:16.640
latter tells Tae-Soo to return back if he can’t&nbsp;
make it work. Realizing that he may no longer have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:22.400
a future at the company if he fails to deliver,&nbsp;
Tae-Soo promises to make it work at any cost.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:28.800
Tae-Soo then notices pictures of the zoo’s annual&nbsp;
soft toy contest on the wall and suddenly, an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:35.120
idea strikes him. He proposes the idea of having&nbsp;
the zookeepers dress up as animals. He stresses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:40.160
that people won’t be able to tell the difference&nbsp;
between a realistic animal costume and an animal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:46.240
from a certain distance. The zoo staff quickly&nbsp;
get on board in the name of saving the zoo but Han&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:51.840
refuses to partake in the foolishness. However,&nbsp;
Tae-Soo plays with Han’s heartstrings by bringing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:57.920
up the story of her becoming a vet because of the&nbsp;
zoo’s polar bear Black Nose, eventually persuading&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:04.480
her. Tae-Soo then contracts a Hollywood costume&nbsp;
designer to design a realistic Lion, Gorilla,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:11.120
Sloth, and polar bear costume. Within two weeks,&nbsp;
they receive the costumes and Seo suggests hiring&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:16.720
actors for the job but Tae-Soo turns down the&nbsp;
suggestion, saying their secret could get out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:24.240
Left with no choice, Han, Hye-kyung, Gun-wook and&nbsp;
Seo become the Lion, Sloth, Gorilla and Polar Bear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:30.080
respectively and the rehearsals begin. Soon,&nbsp;
the zoo’s gates are opened to the public and it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:35.680
receives groups of kindergarten kids and senior&nbsp;
citizens. The zoo staff initially struggle but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:40.880
eventually get the hang of their new job, managing&nbsp;
to fool the visitors. Their effort manages to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:47.200
attract 75 visitors in a week but the numbers are&nbsp;
not enough to keep the zoo open so Tae-Soo insists&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:52.960
on getting a giraffe to lure more visitors. 
Meanwhile, Hye-kyung’s boyfriend Sung-min dumps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:58.320
her after wasting 5-year worth of her savings&nbsp;
on a convenience store near the zoo. Seeing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:04.480
Hye-kyung crying, Gun-wook storms into the store&nbsp;
wearing the gorilla costume and destroys it.
&nbsp;

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:10.320
Sung-min reports the gorilla to the police but&nbsp;
he is brushed aside as a lunatic. The next day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:16.000
Sung-min shows up at the zoo, where Gun-wook again&nbsp;
attacks him as a gorilla, exposing their secret&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:21.280
in the process. After learning about Tae-Soo’s&nbsp;
scam, Sung-min threatens to report them to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:26.720
police but Hye-kyung convinces him against&nbsp;
it and asks Gun-wook to apologize to him.
&nbsp;

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:32.240
Later that night, Tae-Soo visits his costume&nbsp;
designer but to his dismay, he learns that he has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:37.840
taken off with the deposit, leaving behind only&nbsp;
the head of the giraffe in the warehouse. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:44.080
Tae-Soo refuses to give up and he uses the head&nbsp;
of the giraffe to trick his visitors. Soon, Seo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:49.840
falls sick from sitting out in the sun in the hot&nbsp;
costume so Tae-Soo takes over his role. He quickly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:55.520
learns that cosplaying an animal at a zoo isn’t&nbsp;
an easy job as some unruly visitors keep throwing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.520 --> 00:06:00.960
stuff at him. Tae-Soo also gets tired of sitting&nbsp;
in the sun and when no one’s looking, he grabs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:06.800
a coca-cola bottle thrown by one of the visitors&nbsp;
inside the pit and drinks it to quench his thirst.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:12.320
However, some visitors manage to capture&nbsp;
Tae-Soo gulping down the coca cola bottle.
&nbsp;

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:16.720
That day, a representative from JH&nbsp;
arrives at the zoo and reveals that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:21.920
Tae-Soo’s request for animal purchase has been&nbsp;
approved. After giving him a tour of the zoo,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:27.680
Tae-Soo manages to send the rep off. That night,&nbsp;
Tae-Soo gets a call from Song, who tells him about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:33.440
his plans to visit the zoo with his kids. After&nbsp;
seeing JH spending so much money and effort to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:38.960
keep the zoo up and running, Tae-Soo asks Song&nbsp;
about Gabriel and Song reveals that Gabriel is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:45.680
Hwang’s own shell company that he uses to manage&nbsp;
his slush fund much to Tae-Soo's astonishment.
&nbsp;

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:50.640
The next day, a crowd of people show up at the&nbsp;
zoo and Tae-Soo learns that his polar bear has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:55.360
gone viral after the video of the polar bear&nbsp;
drinking coke hit the internet. Tae-Soo and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.360 --> 00:07:00.720
his team couldn’t be more excited and thanks to&nbsp;
the polar bear, the zoo becomes a massive hit.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:05.920
Hundreds of people flock to the zoo everyday to&nbsp;
see the bear drinking coke and over the weekend,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:13.520
the zoo makes a massive profit of $100,000.
One day, Gun-wook finds Hye-kyung despairing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:18.960
by herself and talks to her. She is still&nbsp;
reeling from her breakup and Gun-wook offers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:24.720
to take her out on dinner. Meanwhile, Tae-Soo&nbsp;
notices Black Nose roaming outside in the pit.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:30.880
He then finds Han watching an old childhood video&nbsp;
of Black Nose by herself. She reveals that she let&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:35.920
Black Nose out of the cage so he could get some&nbsp;
fresh air. The two then talk about Black Nose’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:41.600
worsening behavior. She says that no matter how&nbsp;
spacious the zoo is, it is still a cement cage for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:46.720
the polar bear. She reveals that she once had an&nbsp;
opportunity to send the animal to Canada where it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:51.600
could live in the wild but she decided to keep it&nbsp;
around, hoping that if she did her best, it would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:57.840
get better. She laments her decision and thanks&nbsp;
Tae-Soo for saving the zoo before parting ways.
&nbsp;

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:04.240
The next day, Hwang offers Tae-Soo a permanent&nbsp;
position at JH. Tae-soo is ecstatic at the news&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:10.000
but his happiness soon turns into disappointment&nbsp;
when Hwang reveals his plans to bulldoze the zoo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:16.000
and build a resort. Rakwan Group had purchased&nbsp;
over 25 million square feet of land around the zoo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:20.960
and they also wanted to buy the zoo itself&nbsp;
but Hwang’s shell company Gabriel swooped in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:26.000
and bought it up. Hwang then ordered Tae-Soo&nbsp;
to revitalize the zoo so Gabriel could sell the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:31.360
land to Rakwan Group at a much higher price.
Tae-Soo tries to convince Hwang against selling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:36.560
the zoo but Hwang dismisses him. Dejected,&nbsp;
Tae-Soo returns to the zoo to deliver the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:42.480
bad news but he is surprised by Han and others&nbsp;
with a success party. Former employees of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:47.040
zoo also join the party and thank Tae-Soo&nbsp;
for giving them their livelihood back.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:53.200
Seeing them so happy, Tae-Soo can’t bring himself&nbsp;
to break the bad news. However, a former employee&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:59.040
of the zoo from earlier in the movie arrives and&nbsp;
reveals Rakwan’s plans to build a resort on top of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:06.240
the zoo. Tae-Soo confirms the news and the former&nbsp;
employees leave disappointed. Han and others feel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:12.400
cheated by Tae-Soo and refuse to hear him out.
Left with no choice, Tae-Soo returns to his new&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:18.080
job in Seoul and gets on with his life. However,&nbsp;
he still regrets what’s happening to the zoo.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:22.960
When the Rakwan group’s team arrives to demolish&nbsp;
the zoo, Seo gets into an altercation with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:28.640
company staff and injures himself in the process.&nbsp;
The zoo staff reunite in the hospital and Han&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:34.160
proposes a solution. She suggests opening&nbsp;
the zoo and putting Rakwan on blast publicly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:40.080
for trying to demolish it. The public campaign&nbsp;
works and the media and environmental activists&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:46.160
get all over Rakwon like a bad rash. The&nbsp;
development enrages Rakwan’s vice president Ryung&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:51.360
and Hwang promises to remove the miscreant&nbsp;
employees from the zoo premises. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:57.520
it fails to calm Ryung down as her attempts to&nbsp;
revamp the image of the company have tanked badly.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:57.520 --> 00:10:02.960
Hwang promises to resolve the problem as soon&nbsp;
as possible and leaves. Hwang is later visited&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:08.720
by Hye-kyung’s ex-boyfriend Sung-min, who tells&nbsp;
the CEO the truth about the fake zoo animals.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:14.000
Tae-Soo notices Sung-min leaving Hwang’s office&nbsp;
and figures out that he has ratted them out.
&nbsp;

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:19.360
Hwang and his assistant immediately leave for&nbsp;
the zoo and they are closely followed by Tae-Soo.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:25.520
Before Hwang gets to expose them, Tae-Soo alerts&nbsp;
Han and others about the development. Han stops&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:30.080
Hwang from going into the room where the&nbsp;
polar bear is kept. Shortly afterwards,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:34.800
Tae-Soo joins them and Hwang warns him to&nbsp;
tell him the truth about the zoo animals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:40.720
but Tae-Soo continues to feign ignorance.&nbsp;
Enraged, Hwang forces his way into the room&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:46.000
and finds Black Nose sleeping. Mistaking&nbsp;
the bear for a fake one, Hwang challenges&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:51.760
the animal, almost getting himself killed in the&nbsp;
process. To calm Black Nose, Han lets him into the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:57.120
pit while Hwang proceeds to leave. However,&nbsp;
Hwang returns to check the polar bear again&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:57.120 --> 00:11:01.680
when he becomes certain that the giraffe is&nbsp;
fake. Hwang gets into the pit with Black Nose&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:08.000
and challenges him again. Black Nose attacks&nbsp;
him and Hwang passes out. To save his boss,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:13.600
Tae-Soo puts on the polar bear suit and&nbsp;
lures Black Nose away from Hwang. It works&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:18.480
and Hwang is brought back to safety but at&nbsp;
the expense of Tae-Soo who is attacked by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:24.080
the bear. The angry bear tears Tae-Soo’s&nbsp;
suit open, exposing him. But fortunately,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:29.920
Tae-Soo manages to run to safety just in time.
After the public debacle, Tae-Soo apologizes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:34.320
to his team and offers to take all&nbsp;
the blame to protect them. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:39.760
Han and others oppose the idea, saying they&nbsp;
all are as guilty as him. Hye-Kyung wishes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:43.920
outloud that they could do something about&nbsp;
Black Nose and other remaining animals.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:50.160
Suddenly, an idea strikes Tae-Soo yet again.&nbsp;
He claims he can save the zoo and goes to meet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:56.160
Rakwan’s Vice President Ryung. He proposes to run&nbsp;
an ecological park for Ryung’s resort where the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:56.160 --> 00:12:01.440
animals could live. This would not only remove the&nbsp;
roadblock stopping the construction of the resort,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:07.440
but it would also save Rakwan’s image from being&nbsp;
tarnished further. Ryung agrees on the condition&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:13.360
that Tae-Soo gets Gabriel on board. Through his&nbsp;
friend Song, Tae-Soo retrieves hard evidence&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:19.120
of Hwang laundering money using Gabriel. Tae-Soo&nbsp;
then threatens to leak the documents to the press&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:25.280
and police if Hwang doesn’t agree to sell the zoo&nbsp;
to Rakwan. Reluctantly, Hwang agrees to the deal.
&nbsp;

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:31.440
Several years pass by and the movie cuts to a&nbsp;
scene of Ryung presenting a video of the Rakwan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:38.480
eco park consisting of various real wild animals.&nbsp;
Seo and others have been hired by Rakwan Group.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:44.720
Moreover, Black Nose has immigrated to Canada.&nbsp;
The movie ends with Tae-Soo and Han visiting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:49.280
Black Nose in his natural habitat. 
